<div class="u" data-mode="{{mode}}" style="background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); min-height: 2810px;">
  <header class="top" style="padding: 20px 44px;">
    <span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ink);">Homepage images</span>
    <span class="m" style="font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); letter-spacing: 0.06em;">WHAT IS ON THE PAGE, AND THE ALTERNATIVES BESIDE IT</span>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1;"></div>
    <button class="ni" style="width: auto;" onClick="{{toggleTheme}}" aria-label="{{switchLabel}}">
      <sc-if value="{{dark}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle>
          <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M5 5l1.5 1.5M17.5 17.5L19 19M19 5l-1.5 1.5M6.5 17.5L5 19"></path>
        </svg>
      </sc-if>
      <sc-if value="{{light}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M21 13a8.5 8.5 0 01-10-10 8.5 8.5 0 1010 10z"></path>
        </svg>
      </sc-if>
    </button>
  </header>

  <div class="sheet">
    <section class="slot" style="padding-top: 30px;">
      <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 88ch;">
        Four slots, each showing the drawing that is on the page with the alternatives worth a look beside it. Card
        three carries four new ones. Everything is still: the animated round was tried and dropped. No captions
        under the drawings any more.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ card one -->
    <section class="slot">
      <div class="m" style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600;">Card one</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.028em; margin: 10px 0 0;">Connect your traffic</h2>
      <div class="opts three">
        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 370 168" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Six sample calls on the left flowing through one automatic step into three named jobs on the right: invoice extract, support reply and doc classify."><text x="6" y="14" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">incoming calls</text><rect x="6" y="24" width="96" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><rect x="12" y="30" width="18" height="18" rx="5" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><path d="M18.0 35.0 h4.4 l1.9 1.9 v6.6 h-6.3 z" fill="none" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M19.4 39.0 h3.4 M19.4 41.0 h2.2" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1"></path><rect x="36" y="33" width="52" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)"></rect><rect x="36" y="42" width="34" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)" opacity="0.6"></rect><rect x="6" y="58" width="96" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><rect x="12" y="64" width="18" height="18" rx="5" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><path d="M16.8 69.6 h8.4 v5.6 h-4.6 l-2.4 2.1 v-2.1 h-1.4 z" fill="none" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="36" y="67" width="52" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)"></rect><rect x="36" y="76" width="34" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)" opacity="0.6"></rect><rect x="6" y="92" width="96" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><rect x="12" y="98" width="18" height="18" rx="5" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><path d="M19.4 104.0 l-2.6 3.1 2.6 3.1 M22.8 104.0 l2.6 3.1 -2.6 3.1" fill="none" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="36" y="101" width="52" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)"></rect><rect x="36" y="110" width="34" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)" opacity="0.6"></rect><rect x="6" y="126" width="96" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><rect x="12" y="132" width="18" height="18" rx="5" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><rect x="16.7" y="137.8" width="8.6" height="6.4" rx="1.2" fill="none" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><path d="M17.1 138.6 L21.0 141.6 L24.9 138.6" fill="none" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="36" y="135" width="52" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)"></rect><rect x="36" y="144" width="34" height="4.5" rx="2.2" fill="var(--line-strong)" opacity="0.6"></rect><g stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="3 3"><path d="M104 39 C116 39 114 93 126 93"></path><path d="M104 73 C116 73 114 93 126 93"></path><path d="M104 107 C116 107 114 93 126 93"></path><path d="M104 141 C116 141 114 93 126 93"></path></g><path d="M150 41 Q151.4 46.6 157 48 Q151.4 49.4 150 55 Q148.6 49.4 143 48 Q148.6 46.6 150 41 Z" fill="var(--brand)"></path><path d="M159 38 Q159.8 41.2 163 42 Q159.8 42.8 159 46 Q158.2 42.8 155 42 Q158.2 41.2 159 38 Z" fill="var(--brand)" opacity="0.65"></path><text x="150" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">automatic</text><circle cx="150" cy="93" r="22" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><path d="M139 84 L161 84 L152.5 94.5 L152.5 103 L147.5 100 L147.5 94.5 Z" fill="var(--mut)"></path><text x="150" y="141" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">grouped by job</text><path d="M165 78 C186 68 196 50 212 50" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.6"></path><path d="M207 46 l5 4 -5 4" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="217" y="35" width="147" height="30" rx="8" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="230" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><circle cx="240" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><circle cx="260" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><text x="273" y="53" class="m" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="var(--brand)">invoice-extract</text><path d="M172 93 H212" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.6"></path><path d="M207 89 l5 4 -5 4" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="217" y="78" width="147" height="30" rx="8" fill="var(--okq)"></rect><circle cx="230" cy="93" r="3.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="240" cy="93" r="3.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="93" r="3.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="260" cy="93" r="3.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><text x="273" y="96" class="m" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">support-reply</text><path d="M160 112 C182 122 196 136 212 136" fill="none" stroke="var(--warn)" stroke-width="1.6"></path><path d="M207 132 l5 4 -5 4" fill="none" stroke="var(--warn)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><rect x="217" y="121" width="147" height="30" rx="8" fill="var(--warnq)"></rect><circle cx="230" cy="136" r="3.5" fill="var(--warn)"></circle><circle cx="240" cy="136" r="3.5" fill="var(--warn)"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="136" r="3.5" fill="var(--warn)"></circle><text x="273" y="139" class="m" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="var(--warn)">doc-classify</text></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag now">ON THE PAGE</span>Calls into jobs</div><div class="wh">Sample calls on the left, one automatic step in the middle, and the named jobs they land in on the right.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
            <svg viewBox="0 -5 320 130" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Calls fanning out to three job rows marked with the answer shape they ask for, the rows arriving one after another.">
              <g fill="var(--line-strong)"><circle cx="10" cy="46" r="4"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="60" r="4"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="74" r="4"></circle></g>
              <text x="4" y="94" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">your calls</text>
              <g fill="none" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.75">
                <path d="M24,60 C58,60 58,22 92,22" stroke="var(--brand)"></path>
                <path d="M24,60 C58,60 58,60 92,60" stroke="var(--ok)"></path>
                <path d="M24,60 C58,60 58,98 92,98" stroke="var(--warn)"></path>
              </g>
              <g>
                <rect x="96" y="10" width="214" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--brandq)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
                <g stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"><rect x="106" y="16" width="14" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="M110 21 h6"></path></g>
                <text x="128" y="26" class="m" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--brand)">invoice-extract</text><text x="298" y="26" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--brand)">41%</text>
              </g>
              <g>
                <rect x="96" y="48" width="214" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
                <g stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"><path d="M110 54 q-4 6 0 12"></path><path d="M120 54 q4 6 0 12"></path></g>
                <text x="128" y="64" class="m" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--ok)">route-ticket</text><text x="298" y="64" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--ok)">37%</text>
              </g>
              <g>
                <rect x="96" y="86" width="214" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--warnq)" stroke="var(--warn)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
                <g stroke="var(--warn)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"><path d="M106 93 h16"></path><path d="M106 99 h10"></path></g>
                <text x="128" y="102" class="m" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--warn)">chat-summarise</text><text x="298" y="102" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--warn)">22%</text>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag new">L</span>Jobs as rows</div><div class="wh">The same calls arriving as named rows, each marked with the answer shape it asks for. Sibling of card two, which makes the link between the two explicit.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Both keep every label from the version you approved. The difference is the shape: a pile becoming stacks,
            or the same calls landing as named rows.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ card two -->
    <section class="slot">
      <div class="m" style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600;">Card two</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.028em; margin: 10px 0 0;">Auto-run randomized trials</h2>
      <div class="opts three">
        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 370 168" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Sampled calls from one job priced on four models, the cheapest one that clears the quality bar marked chosen, and what you run today at the bottom for scale."><text x="250" y="15" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">COST</text><text x="280" y="15" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">QUALITY BAR</text><line x1="256" y1="20" x2="256" y2="150" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><rect x="6" y="26" width="96" height="92" rx="9" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><text x="54" y="42" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">invoice-extract</text><rect x="14" y="50" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="54.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="62" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="66.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="74" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="78.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="86" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="90.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="98" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="102.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><text x="54" y="131" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">sampled calls</text><path d="M104 60 C118 60 114 37 126 37" fill="none" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 68 C118 68 114 69 126 69" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 80 C118 80 114 101 126 101" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 92 C118 92 114 133 126 133" fill="none" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"></path><rect x="128" y="24" width="236" height="26" rx="7" fill="var(--badq)" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><text x="138" y="40" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--bad)">flash-lite</text><text x="250" y="40" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--bad)">$3</text><circle cx="268" cy="37" r="6" fill="var(--bad)"></circle><path d="M265.8 34.8 L270.2 39.2 M270.2 34.8 L265.8 39.2" stroke="var(--onbrand)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><text x="280" y="40" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--bad)">misses</text><rect x="128" y="56" width="236" height="26" rx="7" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.8"></rect><text x="138" y="72" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">mistral-small</text><text x="250" y="72" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">$8</text><circle cx="268" cy="69" r="6" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><path d="M265.4 69 L267.2 71.0 L270.8 66.8" fill="none" stroke="var(--onbrand)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="280" y="72" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--ok)">clears</text><rect x="314" y="61" width="42" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--ok)"></rect><text x="335" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--onbrand)">chosen</text><rect x="128" y="88" width="236" height="26" rx="7" fill="var(--brandq)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><text x="138" y="104" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--brand)">haiku-4.5</text><text x="250" y="104" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--brand)">$41</text><circle cx="268" cy="101" r="6" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><path d="M265.4 101 L267.2 103.0 L270.8 98.8" fill="none" stroke="var(--onbrand)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="280" y="104" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--brand)">clears</text><rect x="128" y="120" width="236" height="26" rx="7" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><text x="138" y="136" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">what you run now</text><text x="250" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">$212</text><path d="M264 133 h8" stroke="var(--mut)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><text x="280" y="136" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">sets the bar</text><text x="262" y="160" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">higher quality &#8594;</text></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag now">ON THE PAGE</span>Models against the bar</div><div class="wh">Four models priced on the same sampled calls against one quality bar, with the cheapest that clears marked chosen and what you run today for scale.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 320 132" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="The same model rows, each with a bar showing how far it drifted, the bars growing out to their length against the line marking your bar.">
              <g fill="var(--line-strong)"><circle cx="10" cy="46" r="4"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="60" r="4"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="74" r="4"></circle></g>
              <circle cx="10" cy="60" r="8" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
              <g fill="none" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.7">
                <path d="M24,60 C50,60 50,18 76,18" stroke="var(--bad)"></path>
                <path d="M24,60 C50,60 50,46 76,46" stroke="var(--ok)"></path>
                <path d="M24,60 C50,60 50,74 76,74" stroke="var(--brand)"></path>
                <path d="M24,60 C50,60 50,102 76,102" stroke="var(--mut)"></path>
              </g>
              <rect x="80" y="6" width="230" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
              <text x="90" y="22" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">flash-lite</text>
              <rect x="164" y="14" width="86" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--bad)"></rect>
              <text x="302" y="22" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">$3</text>
              <rect x="80" y="34" width="230" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
              <text x="90" y="50" class="m" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">mistral-small</text>
              <rect x="164" y="42" width="22" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--ok)"></rect>
              <text x="302" y="50" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">$8</text>
              <rect x="80" y="62" width="230" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
              <text x="90" y="78" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">haiku-4.5</text>
              <rect x="164" y="70" width="14" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--ok)"></rect>
              <text x="302" y="78" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">$41</text>
              <rect x="80" y="90" width="230" height="24" rx="7" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
              <text x="90" y="106" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">what you run now</text>
              <text x="302" y="106" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--mut)">$212</text>
              <line x1="230" y1="2" x2="230" y2="118" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.8"></line>
              <text x="230" y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="var(--brand)">YOUR BAR</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag new">E</span>Rows with the drift shown</div><div class="wh">The same rows with the drift drawn as a bar against the line marking your bar, so the one that overshoots is visible rather than stated.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            The first shows the price of each model. The second shows how far each one drifted, which is the
            measurement behind the price.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ card three -->
    <section class="slot">
      <div class="m" style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600;">Card three</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.028em; margin: 10px 0 0;">Continuously optimize</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 10px 0 0; max-width: 72ch;">What is on the page, then four other ways to draw the same month over month savings, and the log that was already here.</p>
      <div class="opts three">
        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
