          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag new">U</span>The widening gap</div><div class="wh">Every column is the same height, because that is what you would have paid. The blue is what you actually paid and the green is what you kept, so the saving is the thing that grows.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
