            <rect x="232" y="76" width="110" height="32" rx="8" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
            <g stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M243.5 87.5 L247.5 91.5 L243.5 95.5"></path><path d="M248.5 87.5 L252.5 91.5 L248.5 95.5"></path></g>
            <text x="259" y="95" class="m" font-size="7.5" fill="var(--ink)">Model provider B</text>

            <rect x="6" y="128" width="89" height="32" rx="8" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
            <g stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="14.0" y="143.0" width="9" height="6.5" rx="1.8"></rect><path d="M15.8 143.0 v-2.2 a2.7 2.7 0 0 1 5.4 0 v2.2"></path></g>
            <text x="28" y="147" class="m" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">ZDR AVAILABLE</text>
            <rect x="104" y="128" width="111" height="32" rx="8" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
            <g stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none"><circle cx="116.5" cy="144.0" r="5"></circle><ellipse cx="116.5" cy="144.0" rx="2.2" ry="5"></ellipse><path d="M111.5 144.0 h10"></path></g>
            <text x="126" y="147" class="m" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">EU OR US RESIDENCY</text>
            <rect x="224" y="128" width="130" height="32" rx="8" fill="var(--okq)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
            <g stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="236.5" cy="144.0" r="5"></circle><path d="M236.5 141.0 V144.0 H239.3"></path></g>
            <text x="246" y="147" class="m" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">CONFIGURABLE RETENTION</text>
          </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag now">ON THE PAGE</span>The boundary</div><div class="wh">The region drawn as a container, with the call, the endpoint and the providers it reaches all inside it, and the three commitments named underneath.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="opt">
          <div class="well">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 320 150" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="A card listing where your endpoint runs, that the model keeps nothing, and that your copies are deleted after thirty days, each ticked.">
              <rect x="8" y="8" width="304" height="126" rx="12" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.3"></rect>
              <text x="22" y="30" class="m" font-size="9.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">your endpoint</text>
              <rect x="228" y="18" width="70" height="17" rx="5" fill="var(--okq)"></rect>
              <text x="263" y="30" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">DEDICATED</text>
              <line x1="8" y1="44" x2="312" y2="44" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></line>
              <g stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.9" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M24 62 l4 5 7 -9"></path>
                <path d="M24 90 l4 5 7 -9"></path>
                <path d="M24 118 l4 5 7 -9"></path>
              </g>
              <text x="46" y="67" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">runs in</text>
              <text x="298" y="67" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--ink)">eu-central &middot; frankfurt</text>
              <line x1="22" y1="78" x2="298" y2="78" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></line>
              <text x="46" y="95" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">the model keeps</text>
              <text x="298" y="95" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">nothing</text>
              <line x1="22" y1="106" x2="298" y2="106" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></line>
              <text x="46" y="123" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--mut)">we keep</text>
              <text x="298" y="123" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="9" fill="var(--ink)">30 days, then deleted</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><div class="nm"><span class="tag new">H</span>The credential</div><div class="wh">The same two facts as plain values, plus the one the boundary cannot show: how long we keep your copies.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            The boundary is the one on the page. The credential sits beside it because it answers the question the
            boundary leaves open, which is what becomes of the copy afterwards.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
